          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.9.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 9:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonatani, ömoona o Sauri naarë na ömoona ömöbeeru wa amagörö. Ömoona öyö naarëköbhërëkërö iga Mebhibhoseti. Mebhibhoseti naarë na ëmeeka ëtaano nkaaga amang'ana gu uruku roo Sauri na Yonatani gamöhëkëëyë kurua Yesireri. Hano ömöreri waae aiguurë iga Sauri na Yonatani bhaitëëyöë Yesireri, naimukiri Mebhibhoseti akang'osa nawe. Si nkaaga aarë gökënya ömoona öyö nagöyë akanyahaarëka na aköbheera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rekabhu na Bhaana abhaana bha Rimoni Ömöbheroti, bhagatanöra kuya ka o Isibhoseti. Bhakahika ho ömöbhasö gatai nkaaga Isibhoseti aarë kumuunya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuriihi wë ëgësaku nkanyoora airuuyë ëngano arosërë araayë; igo Rakebhu na mura omoobho Bhaana bhagakunama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hano bhaasohërë mbamunyoorrë araayë köbhörrë bhooe kugisuumua keee ge köraara, bhakamötëbhëta könda bhakamusincha na kömökenga irigoti. Bhakaimukia ömötöe gooe, bhakagëëra guikuuri re Arabha ubhutikö ubhugima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bhakaherra Tauti ömötöë go Isibhoseti Hebhuroni. Bhagateebhia ömögambi iga, “Ömötöë go Isibhoseti ömoona wa Sauri umubhisa waao öno aarë gutuna kuguita ngögöno; ÖMÖNENE aköhakanëyë igisiomba harë Sauri na uruibhöro rooe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Si Tauti agatuenerria Rekabhu na Bhaana mura omoobho, abhaana bha Rimoni Ömöbheroti iga, “Kebhörë ÖMÖNENE amenyërë, öno aatuuria amabhaho gaane kurua harë këra mubhisa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.1.1+2SA.1.2+2SA.1.3+2SA.1.4+2SA.1.5+2SA.1.6+2SA.1.7+2SA.1.8+2SA.1.9+2SA.1.10+2SA.1.11+2SA.1.12+2SA.1.13+2SA.1.14+2SA.1.15+2SA.1.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 1:1-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hano ömöntö aanteebhiri iga, Sauri akuurë, Arakanya iga na amang'ana amaiya aköndentera, naamögootërë na kumuita Sikiragi haara, këyö nkio igituho këno naamöhaayë kömang'ana gaae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkërengere kë ngakorra abhantö abhanyanku bhano bhaitëëyë ömöntö ömöheene nyumba araayë bhörrë bhooe, bhoono naange köbhabhuuria amanyinga gaae na köbhasikia kurua gökëbhara?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igo Tauti agateebhia abhamura bhaae, bhakabhaita bhakabhakenga ëmëtöë na amagörö bhakabhisunga mbarëka yi iritibhöngö Hebhuroni haara. Si bhakaimukia ömötöë go Isibhoseti na kögötökëra kundua ya Abhuneri Hebhuroni haara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
